# Flowchart – Case Study 5

```mermaid
flowchart TD
 A([Start]) --> B[/Input transaction ID, amount and type/]
 B --> C[Normalize ID and type]
 C --> D[Store transaction tuple]
 D --> E{Amount positive?}
 E -- No --> F[Flag invalid amount]
 E -- Yes --> G{Type is DEPOSIT or WITHDRAWAL?}
 G -- No --> H[Flag invalid type]
 G -- Yes --> I[Check high-value threshold]
 F --> J[Check duplicate transaction ID]
 H --> J
 I --> J
 J --> K{Duplicate ID?}
 K -- Yes --> L[Flag duplicate]
 K -- No --> M[Keep current flags]
 L --> N[Display VALID or FLAGGED]
 M --> N
 N --> O{More transactions?}
 O -- Yes --> B
 O -- No --> P([Stop])
```
